WEBVTT

00:04:59.211 --> 00:05:04.633
We watched in disbelief as 20 years
of progress in women's rights, education,

00:05:04.675 --> 00:05:06.344
freedom of expression

00:05:06.385 --> 00:05:09.096
disappeared in 20 days.

00:05:10.097 --> 00:05:13.351
On August 15, the day
that Taliban took over Kabul,

00:05:13.351 --> 00:05:15.102
I left the house at 4am

00:05:15.144 --> 00:05:18.147
and headed to the airport
to photograph Afghans

00:05:18.189 --> 00:05:22.193
who were desperately trying to leave
in anticipation of Taliban's victory.

00:05:22.610 --> 00:05:25.780
By noon, Taliban fighters
were marching on the streets,

00:05:25.780 --> 00:05:26.947
and by early evening,

00:05:26.989 --> 00:05:29.200
they had taken over
the presidential palace.

00:05:29.658 --> 00:05:33.412
It was one of the most difficult decisions
of my life to leave that day.